Note on AI-generated content
-----------------------------
The vast majority of this codebase was written by Claude Code, an AI coding
assistant, under human direction and review. Authorship law around
AI-generated work is unsettled and varies by jurisdiction; in any
jurisdiction where such content is not recognized as eligible for copyright
protection in the first place (e.g. output with no sufficient human
authorship), no exclusive right is asserted over it there, and it may be
treated as public domain. Where copyright does subsist, it is licensed under
the MIT terms above -- which already permit unrestricted use, modification,
and redistribution, commercial or otherwise.
